300
01:35:05,540 --> 01:35:14,940
Selling millions of copies, The Hunger Games trilogy captured the hearts and minds of many readers, and eventually became a hit film of the same name.

301
01:35:16,372 --> 01:35:24,372
As always happens when something does well commercially, studios take notice and begin adapting other popular young adult novels into movies.

302
01:35:25,372 --> 01:35:34,372
