01:37:08,476 --> 01:37:18,476
1. Death anxiety. Dystopian films, and particularly those of the post-apocalyptic variety, are fictional portrayals of real world anxiety.

313
01:37:19,188 --> 01:37:36,887
Just as the ancient Sumerians used the Epic of Gilgamesh to cope with their fear of an unpredictable river, we use films like Avengers, Age of Ultron, and Ex Machina to take control of our fears of killer robots, and films like Mad Max to deal with our very legitimate fears of environmental destruction.

314
01:37:39,923 --> 01:38:03,244
